;. /invoke_action_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition invoke_action
  ;= Invoke retained actions through native admission
    Actions must be explicitly prepared Goo requests. The existing native provider owns execution, guards, attempt identity and receipts. A receipt establishes acceptance, not a postcondition. Keep this stage separate from observation so evidence changes do not repeat an accepted action.

    ;@ /flow/input actions
    ;= actions

    ;@ /flow/step responses ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/request_actions
    ;@ /flow/bind actions actions
    ;= responses

    ;@ /flow/step receipts ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/receipts
    ;@ /flow/bind responses responses
    ;= receipts

    ;@ /flow/result receipts
    ;= Invoke retained actions through native admission result
